  {
    "board": "explore_lenses",
    "key": "confluence_body",
    "entry": {
      "en": "Every sub-industry as its own basket, scored for entry timing. The read below is answer-first: the rotation backdrop, which groups just turned buyable, which are late or fading, and the stocks firing inside a group with the wind at its back. A timing map. Confirm before acting.",
      "zh": "将每个子行业视作独立篮子，按入场时机评分。下方读数以结论优先：轮动情况、哪些子行业刚转为可买、哪些已偏晚或转弱，以及在顺风子行业中触发的个股。择时图。行动前请确认。",
      "role": "body",
      "source": "templates/sector_central.html.j2:2460"
    },
    "refs": [
      "templates/sector_central.html.j2"
    ]
  },
  {
    "board": "explore_lenses",
    "key": "confluence_footnote",
    "entry": {
      "en": "Every subsector is an equal-weight basket of its members, scored on a 3-day cadence for entry timing, not a buy list.",
      "zh": "每个子行业为其成分的等权篮子，按 3 日周期为入场时机评分，并非买入清单。层级衡量汇聚交叉的新鲜度（T1 最新）。",
      "role": "footnote",
      "source": "templates/sector_central.html.j2:2473"
