  {
    "board": "cycles",
    "key": "intro_body",
    "entry": {
      "en": "The 11 GICS sector ETFs on one cycle clock: real price (rebased & log, so every line shares an axis) with a one-tap cycle-position view. Peaks & troughs are auto-detected from the tape, each sector is graded by where it sits in its cycle, and clicking a leg tells you what drove the move. Projections here are windows, not certainties: re-drawn nightly as new data lands.",
      "zh": "11 个 GICS 板块 ETF 同处一张周期时钟：真实价格（再基准化并取对数，使每条线共用同一坐标轴），并可一键切换为周期位置视图。波峰与波谷由价格走势自动识别，每个板块按其周期所处阶段评级，点击任一区段即可了解推动该走势的原因。这里的预测是时间窗口，而非确定性结论：每晚随新数据重新计算。",
      "role": "body",
      "source": "templates/sector_cycles.html.j2:40"
    },
    "refs": [
      "templates/sector_cycles.html.j2"
    ]
  },
